# netflix-content-analytics-dashboard
Interactive Netflix Content Analytics Dashboard built using Power BI to analyze movies, TV shows, ratings, genres, countries, and release trends.
## Project Overview

This Power BI dashboard provides insights into Netflix's content library, including movies, TV shows, ratings, genres, countries, and release trends.

## Key Metrics
- Total Shows
- Total Ratings
- Total Countries
- Total Cast Members
- Total Genres
- Total Directors

## Dashboard Features
- Ratings Distribution
- Genre Analysis
- Content Type Distribution (Movies vs TV Shows)
- Country-wise Content Analysis
- Release Year Trends
- Top Producing Countries
- Interactive Filters and Slicers

## Tools Used
- Power BI
- DAX
- Power Query
- Data Modeling
- Data Visualization

